# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF，根绝 CRLF 噪音 diff（此前 index.html/smart-canvas.html 混合行尾导致数千行假 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理 / Inno Setup 安装脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 与 ISCC 解析异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产（图片/字体/音视频）不归一化
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
